{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3wj3aXihwimJTz3ioX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, scarred by centuries of hands and weather.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully in the low light, shaped like a ward lock — old, intricate, waiting.*\n\n*You hold out a key.*\n\n*But which key? The keyhole watches, patient as stone. The tumblers inside are silent, unpressed. A key without teeth that match is just a piece of metal.*\n\n*The door does not open.*\n\n*The door does not move.*\n\n*The lock remains.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":127,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}